  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Metadata is now rendered from the first log event written to a new queue, so event-based layouts like ${event-properties} work with a per-event queueName (#215)\n- Metadata with includeEmptyValue=\"true\" is now set even when it renders empty (#215)\n- Fixed message loss when Azure rejects queue metadata (for example a name that is not a valid C# identifier): the queue is now created without it and an error is logged (#215)\n- Rendered metadata values are trimmed and characters Azure does not accept (non-ASCII, control characters) are replaced with '_' (#215)\n\nDocs: https://github.com/JDetmar/NLog.Extensions.AzureStorage/blob/master/src/NLog.Extensions.AzureQueueStorage/README.md",
